["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陆大鹏谈莎士比亚戏剧与英国历史的互相影响 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁历史剧歪曲史实极多，本质是都铎王朝的政治宣传：丑化理查三世、回避亨利八世敏感话题，从而巩固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亚</span><span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因：福利申请像一场时间税</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利项目中的行政负担不是效率问题，而是社会控制工具：它用羞辱和文书惩罚穷人，把进步政策变成筛选少数人的漏斗，最终让受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政负担</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Back by Popular Demand: How to support your child&#x27;s secure attachment even if you didn&#x27;t grow up with it with Dr. Miriam Steele Strange Situation Adult Attachment Interview reflective functioning good enough mother still face\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-secureattach-童年逆境不必传给孩子-会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>童年逆境不必传给孩子：会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伦敦亲子项目发现，父母能否用连贯、灵活的方式讲述自己的童年，比童年本身好坏更能预测孩子是否安全依恋——反思功能是可训练的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">养育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Parallel’s Parag Agrawal: Building a New Web for AI Agents Shapley value grounding fresh index memory hierarchy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-trainingdata-人类点击数据是-bug-agent-搜索重建网络经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca134f7cdc5e5aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>人类点击数据是 Bug：Agent 搜索要重做索引与定价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当搜索的客户从人变成 Agent，点击数据失效，索引、定价与商业模式都要重来；Parag 用质量/成本/延迟三角和 Shapley 给出新框架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 搜索</span><span class=\"tag\">网络经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Neil Movva - Making AI 10x Cheaper - [Invest Like the Best, EP.488] KV cache HBM SRAM Tensor Core Harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ilt-推理成本需降3-6个数量级-后台任务才是主战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e8a839c878b0c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>后台Agent将吃掉90%算力，推理优化该为吞吐牺牲延迟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的下一波不在聊天而在后台Agent，后者将吃掉90%算力。Sale Research为此优化吞吐而非延迟，甚至接受80%可用性，以换取价格降几个数量级，并认为Nvidia每瓦优势被高估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Clayton Page Aldern &amp; The Weight of Nature BMAA DLPFC vmPFC Naegleria fowleri presenteeism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-tpwky-气候变暖不只融化冰川-还在重塑你的大脑决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>气候变暖不只融化冰川，还在重塑你的大脑决策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大脑是环境的统计模型，气候是人为设定的正常值基准。当基准本身在移动，遗忘就成了适应机制——你会在不知不觉中把异常当成常态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候神经科学</span><span class=\"tag\">认知功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"286: ENCORE: Getting into College with Rick Clark holistic review test-optional Common App FAFSA net price calculator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-asklisa-申请没有万能配方-美国大学录取的反焦虑真相/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">48:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>录取没有万能配方：美国大学申请的反焦虑真相</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低录取率只是全国约 80 所名校的叙事；对多数家庭，录取没有公式，家长最有用的是固定会议和「控制可控项」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美本申请</span><span class=\"tag\">录取率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Handling Our Kids&#x27; Explosive Anger (with Loryn Brantz) spicy nugget PDA (pathological demand avoidance) Jack in the Box Syndrome radical acceptance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-unruffled-孩子暴怒时你越插手越糟-他在那个状态里听不见你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">28:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>孩子暴怒时你越插手越糟，他在那个状态里听不见你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子的暴怒不是对你的攻击，是前额叶还没长好时的失控——他在那个状态里听不见任何道理。大人急着劝、急着讲理，处理的其实是自己的不适；有用的是待在旁边，等他自己走完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Auschwitz: An SS officer’s photo album Solahütte Counterintelligence Corps Frankfurt Auschwitz Trials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-witness-纳粹屠夫的私人相册-没有惨状只有蓝莓和假期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>纳粹军官相册里没有暴行，只有蓝莓和假期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一本 SS 军官私人相册记录的并非暴行，而是度假、聚餐和摘蓝莓；它证明屠杀者清楚自己在做什么，也提醒我们理解大屠杀必须看向施害者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大屠杀</span><span class=\"tag\">纳粹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84.49 家央企采买进场，史上最热WRC：泡沫被挤压，具身行业进入实战阶段｜14 年从业者的行家鉴别指南 VLA World Model Teleoperation EMG Data Pipeline Post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-lightstar-两万台出货九成吃灰-具身行业进入算roi的实战期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/adbddf5c93cfc63c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>两万台出货九成吃灰：具身行业进入算ROI的实战期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WRC的热浪之下，真正做预训练的创业公司可能只有一两家，真实落地需求可能只有出货量的10%，行业已从秀demo进入算ROI的实战阶段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Intel&#x27;s New CPU Finally Makes Sense Fan-out fabric architecture Compute building block Fabric hub UCIe Foveros 3D Direct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-下一代-xeon-把宝押在-1-2gb-末级缓存上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc7c90dc34e0b3f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 弃用 EMIB 改 UCIe：1.2GB 缓存堆出 256 核</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Diamond Rapids 预计 2027 年发布，最高 256 个 P-core、1.2GB 末级缓存、16 通道 DDR5；用可裁剪的 compute building block 和 UCIe 互连取代 EMIB，大缓存是它对抗 AI 时代的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU 架构</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Michael Kratsios: Trump&#x27;s Science Agenda, Anti-Science Claims, Fauci&#x27;s Damage, DEI &amp; China Eroom&#x27;s Law golden tickets RCP 8.5 GRFP Genesis Mission OSTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-allin-美国科学不是缺钱-是花钱方式错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/527571f45bcd0e49-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>美国科学不是缺钱，是花钱方式错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NIH 预算从 1998 年 140 亿涨到 2024 年 470 亿，产出效率却每 9 年腰斩一次。Kratsios 的答案是：问题不在预算数字，在拨款机制本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技政策</span><span class=\"tag\">科研拨款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"95% of AI Agent Projects Fail to Reach Production. Here&#x27;s Why | Manoj Saxena, TrustWise runtime governance AI control tower guardian agents semantic action layer trust posture management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-eyeonai-智能体流量首超人类-ai-失控才是落地最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b277eb062496b5a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>95% 的 AI 智能体项目死在试点：缺的不是智能，是控制层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已从内容生成走向自主行动：95% 的 agent 项目困在 pilot，进不了生产，因为缺的不是智能，而是运行时控制层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Will Photonics Loosen the Bottlenecks in Neural Systems? WDM (Wavelength Division Multiplexing) Semiconductor Optical Amplifier (SOA) McCulloch-Pitts neuron model Indium Phosphide (InP) Femtojoule per operation TDM (Time Division Multiplexing)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-brainsandmachi-光子计算第三次浪潮-五年内走出实验室-先征服无人机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9151fd6dae1293cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brains and Machines</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>光子计算第三次浪潮：五年内走出实验室，先征服无人机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光子不能像电子那样相互作用，却能用波长复用实现超大并行和超低延迟。全光学神经网络五年内有望落地，第一站不是服务器，而是无人机和实时控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">神经形态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Has the Solid State Transformer’s Time Finally Come? Solid State Transformer (SST) IGBT Silicon Carbide (SiC) Galvanic isolation 800VDC architecture PETT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-asianometry-固态变压器吹了五十年-ai数据中心是第一个真买家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a4d5049243d5f237-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>固态变压器吹了五十年，AI数据中心是第一个真买家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">固态变压器在海军、高铁、智能电网里试了三次都没成，因为它只是「更小」,而AI数据中心的铜线和800伏直流问题第一次给了它必须存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力电子</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心供电</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"317. Plot Twist: The Second Story Hiding Inside Every Great Pitch pitch gatekeeper auteur\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-thinkfast-好提案藏着两个故事-你的故事和对方升职的故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fd7a03d438b4365-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>提案要讲两个故事：一个是项目，一个是对方升职</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">好莱坞编剧 Rhett Reese 揭示提案的本质：表面讲项目故事，暗线讲对方成功的故事。把对方当主角，降低风险、放大回报，提案成功率大增。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提案技巧</span><span class=\"tag\">沟通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"365 | Vitor Cardoso on Why Black Holes Are Special no-hair theorem Kerr metric light ring cosmic censorship matched filtering last parsec problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-mindscape-黑洞只有两个参数-形成机制却仍是谜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞只有两个参数，形成机制却仍是谜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">引力波与 EHT 确认黑洞确实只有两个参数，但 120 倍太阳质量的黑洞如何形成、暗物质是否由微型黑洞构成、最后 1 秒差距如何跨越，都是未解之谜。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">引力波</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Are We Alone? Cosmic Loneliness and the Longing to Believe (with Adam Kirsch) UAP euphemism treadmill book experience Drake equation AATIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-econtalk-所有外星人想象都是人类的自画像/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>UFO 热潮不是天文问题，是信仰问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当证据停留在证词，宇宙是否拥挤就成了信仰问题。科学越进步，地外生命在观测里越稀有；我们谈论UFO时，真正在谈的其实是自己。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">UFO</span><span class=\"tag\">外星生命</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Medical AI Needs a Referee | Protege&#x27;s Engy Ziedan evals misalignment subnode harness value-based purchasing hedonics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-a16z-医疗-ai-考满分也进不了医院-缺一个独立裁判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">35:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>医疗 AI 考满分也进不了医院：缺一个独立裁判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型能答对几千道医学题，却可能在一个真实临床任务上只有 45% 的正确率。问题不在模型不够聪明，而在没人独立地、持续地测它在真实场景里到底行不行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kidneys for sale repugnant transaction market design non-directed donor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-grayarea-禁止卖肾的代价-本不该失去的生命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>禁卖肾的代价：每年 13 万新症，移植不足 3 万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国每年 13 万新肾衰病例、移植不足 3 万，Al Roth 拆解器官买卖的「反感」来源，论证有监管的补偿能救命且避免剥削。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肾脏移植</span><span class=\"tag\">器官买卖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How to Improve Motivation &amp; Overcome Procrastination | Dr. Masud Husain apathy basal ganglia activation energy wanting vs liking\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-huberman-动机不是欲望问题-而是激活能量障碍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e03163dcfb779e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>拖延不是懒，是大脑觉得太费劲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经科医生 Masud Husain 用病例和脑成像证明：拖延和冷漠源于感知到的努力成本过高，而非缺乏欲望。降低激活能量、提前规划、分解任务，是绕过障碍的实用策略。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">动机</span><span class=\"tag\">拖延</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Nigerian Industrial Behemoth That Could Reshape the African Economy flying geese paradigm resource curse developmental state kulak demonstration effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-oddlots-非洲工业化不缺资源-缺的是人口密度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>非洲不缺资源，缺的是人口密度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dangote靠垄断特许起家，自掏200亿美元建成尼日利亚炼油厂并成为非洲首富，但Studwell认为决定非洲能否复制亚洲奇迹的关键变量是人口密度带来的城市市场规模，而不是矿产资源或援助。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲经济</span><span class=\"tag\">产业政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Becomes a Political Crisis augmentative vs automation regulatory capture AI safety in parallel Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-chinatalk-ai-失业不需要-10-半个百分点就能引爆政治/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46a2145835a8e9a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>AI 失业不需要 10%，半个百分点就能引爆政治</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正触发政治危机的不是失业率数字，而是几个高度本地化的裁员案例被讲成 AI 故事。而所有精准打击 AI 的税，都会连带打击那些能缓解冲击的增强型用途。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">劳动力市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Uruguay&#x27;s water referendum concession mate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-witness-供水私有化不是宿命-乌拉圭公投的水权胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>供水私有化不是宿命：乌拉圭公投的水权胜利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2004年10月31日，乌拉圭人以64.7%的赞成票把「水是生命必需资源」写入宪法，并规定供水只能由国家提供，成为世界第一个用宪法锁死供水私有化的国家。那场运动的起点，是一处海滨城市的水龙头被关闭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">水权</span><span class=\"tag\">公投</span>\n</div></div></a>"]